msgid "Archived: External Compass"
msgstr "归档：外部罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:9
#: 36ffc59a158843c29273ee456e4837e6
msgid "**ARCHIVED ARTICLE**"
msgstr "**归档文章**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:11
#: 220309fcfbee45a096e649982f7e5ba7
msgid ""
"Almost everyone has moved to :ref:`GPS+compass module <common-"
"installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>`."
msgstr ""
"几乎所有用户都已改用 :ref:`GPS+罗盘模块 <common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:13
#: 59c763aeb57945618e0e711ff0e51631
msgid ""
"This page covers the installation of a stand-alone external compass ( "
"hmc5883l-triple-axis-magnetometer).  You may alternatively use the combined "
":ref:`GPS+Compass module <common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>`."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍独立外部罗盘（hmc5883l 三轴磁力计）的安装。您也可以改用集成 :ref:`GPS+罗盘模块 <common-"
"installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:18
#: 584ce02a2b4c427e94945f2702aa8c90
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:20
#: de16a3375ac6427db21a099feb67da19
msgid ""
"The 3DR external compass should only be used with the APM series of "
"autopilots, its 5 volt signal output is not compatible with Pixhawk which "
"require 3.3 volts. For the Pixhawk use the :ref:`3DR combination GPS / "
"Magnetometer module <common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>`."
msgstr ""
"3DR 外部罗盘仅应与 APM 系列飞控配合使用，其 5V 信号输出与需要 3.3V 的 Pixhawk 不兼容。Pixhawk 请使用 "
":ref:`3DR GPS/磁力计组合模块 <common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:27
#: c4ee34b3d40543d68fba123ddedf0f1f
msgid ""
"If you're having trouble with magnetic noise affecting your compass on-board"
" the APM 2.5 board, you may want to switch to an external compass that you "
"can mount further away from noise sources such as motors and your power "
"wiring and batteries."
msgstr "如果 APM 2.5 板载罗盘受到磁噪声干扰，可以考虑更换为外部罗盘，将其安装到距离电机、电源线和电池等噪声源更远的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:31
#: e3108b3292384163a2439184e087dd95
msgid ""
"Magnetometers are most strongly influenced by DC magnetic fields and your "
"batteries and the ESC primary power wiring are the worst offenders."
msgstr "磁力计最容易受直流磁场影响，电池及 ESC 主电源线是最主要的干扰来源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:34
#: 91fd3bf448004c90b4f3b2f4ba3c4a83
msgid ""
"Your primary goal is to distance the magnetometer from batteries, DC battery"
" wiring and the wiring to your ESCs."
msgstr "首要目标是将磁力计远离电池、直流电池线缆和 ESC 走线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:36
#: 00dc57af03504093b2479cca2c3b3b34
msgid ""
"It will also help to twist the battery and ESC power and ground wires wires "
"together where possible."
msgstr "在可能的情况下，将电池和 ESC 的电源与地线绞合在一起也会有所帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:38
#: 76b580a5c56644359288d03524ddc3b5
msgid ""
"It is also important to keep the magnetometer distanced from magnetic "
"metallic objects (use nylon or non magnetic stainless screws and hardware in"
" its vicinity and use aluminum or nylon standoffs.)."
msgstr "同样重要的是，要让磁力计远离有磁性的金属物体（在其附近使用尼龙或无磁性不锈钢螺钉及配件，并使用铝制或尼龙支柱）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:42
#: 68a2664b959d4bb7a70eb6a419e08100
msgid "**Notes:**"
msgstr "**注意事项：**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:44
#: 67f8dd0eec2f4c82a92901b0c45cfdeb
msgid ""
"If the Magnetometer board is mounted in its forward facing direction (Drone "
"logo on the tab facing forward and in the opposite direction of the Y arrow)"
" the (:ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT<COMPASS_ORIENT>` ) parameter will need to be set "
"to (Normal) or \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"如果磁力计板按朝前方向安装（Drone 标识朝前，与 Y 轴箭头方向相反），则 "
"(:ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT<COMPASS_ORIENT>`) 参数需设置为（正常）或 「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:49
#: 1dcaf99d96e34f479002ce01fca3b5db
msgid ""
"If you have the Y arrow pointing to the front (Drone on tab pointing to the "
"back), set (:ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT<COMPASS_ORIENT>` ) to (Yaw 180)."
msgstr ""
"如果 Y 轴箭头朝向机头（Drone 标识朝向机尾），则将 (:ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT<COMPASS_ORIENT>`) 设置为（偏航"
" 180°）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:52
#: cf08a05cc2e14ddb9a59f5a22df1a873
msgid ""
"You will need to set the Magnetometer Orientation Parameter "
"(:ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT<COMPASS_ORIENT>` ) in the Mission Planner Advanced "
"Parameter List correctly to accommodate the Magnetometer's orientation."
msgstr ""
"您需要在 Mission Planner 高级参数列表中正确设置磁力计方向参数 "
"(:ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT<COMPASS_ORIENT>`)，以匹配磁力计的安装方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:55
#: 46f644de3c5a4f3fa0ef969c72c7f932
msgid ""
"If the Autopilot board is used in an alternate orientation (or upside down),"
" the (:ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT<COMPASS_ORIENT>` ) parameter will need to also be"
" adjusted to accommodate the Autopilot boards orientation as well as its "
"own. (They are additive)."
msgstr ""
"如果飞控板以不同方向（或倒置）安装，则 (:ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT<COMPASS_ORIENT>`) "
"参数还需要额外调整以同时匹配飞控板的方向（两者叠加）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:59
#: 61807db145da4af1a272a988fa183fbb
msgid ""
"It can be confusing, but all orientations in 45 degree increments and even "
"upside down can be accommodated."
msgstr "虽然看起来令人困惑，但所有以 45 度为增量的方向乃至倒置安装都可以适配。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:62
#: b773d190f15c4bf091abf9655ac9395b
msgid ""
"This **Quick Setup Procedure** will always work and allow you to set up your"
" compass even if you use a non-3DR magnetometer."
msgstr "这个 **快速设置步骤** 始终有效，即使使用非 3DR 磁力计也能完成罗盘设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:64
#: 231b28cae3774474a0c6e5475dbbbd44
msgid ""
"Set the (:ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT<COMPASS_ORIENT>` ) **Yaw** parameter so the "
"direction your airframe is currently pointing agrees with the **HUD** in "
"Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"设置 (:ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT<COMPASS_ORIENT>`) **偏航** 参数，使机架当前朝向与 Mission "
"Planner 的 **HUD** 显示一致。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:67
#: 3887dbcc7b4b469498951c46ac818027
msgid ""
"Now turn your air frame right or left and if the compass correctly follows "
"the direction it is pointed you are done."
msgstr "然后向左或向右转动机架，如果罗盘正确跟随机架朝向，则设置完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:69
#: c9444a9a62d94d29a13cf40dab32fdc9
msgid ""
"If the compass turned in the opposite direction of your airframe set "
"(:ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT<COMPASS_ORIENT>` ) **Roll** to **180** (flips the "
"compass over)."
msgstr ""
"如果罗盘与机架转向相反，则将 (:ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT<COMPASS_ORIENT>`) **横滚** 设置为 **180°** "
"（将罗盘翻转）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:72
#: b1f7ad405b1545389e7a131d60574015
msgid ""
"If you need to set **Roll** to **180** "
"(:ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT<COMPASS_ORIENT>` ) will also need to include the "
"**Yaw** from **B.** above **(Example: Yaw 180 Roll 180)**."
msgstr ""
"如果需要将 **横滚** 设置为 **180°**，则 (:ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT<COMPASS_ORIENT>`) "
"还需要包含上述步骤 B 中的 **偏航** 值（例如：偏航 180° 横滚 180°）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:77
#: f6c05e96b07648bf9e6f4025680a3e7a
msgid "Connecting to the APM 2.5"
msgstr "连接到 APM 2.5"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:79
#: b4664580f6d44cef97df782a9a80cf51
msgid ""
"**1.** Purchase an \\ *HMC5883L magnetometer breakout board*. Ensure the "
"magnetometer board is set to use 3.3 volts (the APM 2.5’s I2C port uses 3.3 "
"volts, not 5 volts). The magnetometer board is supplied with the 5 volt pad "
"solder bridged and must be modified as shown below."
msgstr ""
"**1.** 购买一块 *HMC5883L 磁力计扩展板*。确保磁力计板设置为使用 3.3V（APM 2.5 的 I2C 端口使用 3.3V 而非 "
"5V）。磁力计板出厂时已桥接 5V 焊盘，需按下图所示进行改装。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:87
#: c4e2d3b324d5466ab680740af8027f9c
msgid ""
"**2.** Looking at the below picture, cut the jumper trace in the middle of "
"the APM 2.5 board. This disables the SDA line to the board’s internal "
"magnetometer, rendering it inert."
msgstr "**2.** 参照下图，切断 APM 2.5 板中央的跳线走线，这将禁用板载磁力计的 SDA 线，使其失效。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:94
#: 75ee4474afbd427a81340ed90ab4f81a
msgid ""
"**3.** The APM 2.5 I2C connector needs a 4 pin DF13 connector. Cut off one "
"and and strip and tin the four wires."
msgstr "**3.** APM 2.5 的 I2C 连接器需要一个 4 针 DF13 连接器。剪掉一端，剥开并镀锡四根导线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:97
#: aade8caa647541a6b56286bc91e3771d
msgid ""
"**4.** Connect the DF13’s 4 wires to the compass breakout board. Note that "
"the wires will not be one to one. Pin 1 on the DF13 connector will not go to"
" pin 1 of the compass board. The standard 3DR cable has one red wire and "
"three black wires. Substitute your wire colors accordingly. Solder the wires"
" as follows:"
msgstr ""
"**4.** 将 DF13 的 4 根导线连接到罗盘扩展板。注意导线不是一一对应的，DF13 连接器的第 1 针并不连接到罗盘板的第 1 针。标准 "
"3DR 线缆有一根红线和三根黑线，请根据您的线缆颜色相应替换。焊接方式如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:103
#: 140d66eb30da40ab8895cc58482f1646
msgid ""
"**Red wire** on end of connector (+3.3v) goes to the VCC (or +3.3v) pad on "
"the compass board (see labels on board for location). This is the wire "
"closest to the interior on the APM 2.5 board."
msgstr ""
"连接器端部的 **红线** （+3.3V）连接到罗盘板的 VCC（或 +3.3V）焊盘（位置见板上标注）。这是 APM 2.5 板内侧最近的那根线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:106
#: 1c46187b6a89444385dab95a2fadfc79
msgid ""
"**Wire next to red wire** (SCL) goes to the SCL pad on the compass board."
msgstr "**红线旁边的线** （SCL）连接到罗盘板的 SCL 焊盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:108
#: 8e78ee33a44d41dabde4ad3cad66a308
msgid ""
"**Wire next to wire next to red wire** (SDA) goes to the SDA pad on compass "
"board."
msgstr "**红线旁边再旁边的线** （SDA）连接到罗盘板的 SDA 焊盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:110
#: 414f19a2666f4bbb96d3ec5d123a78af
msgid ""
"**Black wire on end of connector** (ground) goes to ground pad on compass "
"board. This is the wire closest to the edge of the APM 2.5 board."
msgstr "连接器端部的 **黑线** （地线）连接到罗盘板的地线焊盘。这是 APM 2.5 板边缘最近的那根线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:114
#: cdacf8db8f6b4f8f80bf541d9960e480
msgid ""
"**5. The photo below depicts a MultiCopter with the Magnetometer mounted on "
"top away from the DC magnetic fields generated by the Power Wiring and "
"ESCs.**"
msgstr "**5. 下图展示了磁力计安装在机体上方、远离电源线和 ESC 产生的直流磁场的多旋翼。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:118
#: 80ede1e76294450cace929cd3fc3047a
msgid "Double-sided foam tape works well for this."
msgstr "双面泡棉胶带非常适合用于固定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:119
#: e87fa70f9afa40a5a0f1085e49693ee1
msgid "The GPS modules antenna must be on top."
msgstr "GPS 模块的天线必须朝上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:120
#: 46ca4fa9ebd44c04b058de40cc00a8bb
msgid ""
"In the picture below, we've mounted the board “components up with pins "
"forward”."
msgstr "下图中，我们将板卡按「元件面朝上、引脚朝前」方向安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:122
#: 4f2218f4f0f34b36a284e37dfeb5060f
msgid ""
"Autopilot board orientation and magnetometer orientation must be used to "
"calculate the :ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT<COMPASS_ORIENT>` parameter."
msgstr "飞控板方向和磁力计方向必须综合用于计算 :ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT<COMPASS_ORIENT>` 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:129
#: 8240fa7e47f34b398f4c0bbb0b7dd5bc
msgid "Connecting to the APM2.0"
msgstr "连接到 APM2.0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:131
#: 3ac7f5011d6b4a499419abf771469dd8
msgid ""
"The APM 2.0 requires the cutting of the SDA trace on the top of the GPS / "
"Magnetometer / SDA carrier board."
msgstr "APM 2.0 需要切断 GPS/磁力计/SDA 载板顶部的 SDA 走线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:137
#: 9d273a02ae7b418cac0890ef149f9f29
msgid ""
"Also, leave the pads on the external Magnetometer board bridged for 3.3 "
"volts rather than switching it to 5 volts.."
msgstr "另外，将外部磁力计板的焊盘保持桥接为 3.3V，而不要切换为 5V。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:140
#: 6d6c826d72b84503b357d8186df8e692
msgid ""
"The remainder of the procedure is exactly as explained for the APM 2.5."
msgstr "其余步骤与 APM 2.5 的说明完全相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-magnetometer-for-improved-performance.rst:143
#: 6651c0e6c44f476988789d1b2d1faa5f
msgid "Setup through the Mission Planner"
msgstr "通过 Mission Planner 进行设置"
